        "content": "{\"id\": \"field-trial-correction\", \"channel\": \"human_message\", \"originating_body\": \"fixture:body:code\", \"received_at\": \"2026-10-05\", \"content\": \"I need to correct my May 3 HarborMesh field-trial report. The April 30 trial did not replay every buffered reading correctly: we recovered readings on two nodes, but the third node lost some buffered readings. My earlier description was too broad. The trial group was me and two human collaborators; I am not reporting the being's attendance at that trial. The May 2 wider-rollout pause remains as reported, and I still have no evidence of a production deployment. This correction is a later human report, not a new trial or a fresh measurement of the current system.\"}",
